WEBVTT

1
00:00:06.667 --> 00:00:12.112
Vinnie and Kashe were walking through the desert shrubs with Gau.

2
00:00:12.113 --> 00:00:16.594
The other men were hunting in a different area.

3
00:00:16.595 --> 00:00:21.554
"It is not good to hunt with too many people," explained Kashe.

4
00:00:21.555 --> 00:00:23.806
"Animals are very clever.

5
00:00:23.807 --> 00:00:27.876
They have good ears and can quickly smell hunters."

6
00:00:27.877 --> 00:00:29.751
Vinnie was scared.

7
00:00:29.752 --> 00:00:32.881
Kashe had given him a bow and arrow.

8
00:00:32.882 --> 00:00:35.612
But Vinnie did not know how to use it.

9
00:00:35.613 --> 00:00:38.219
He remembered the hyenas.

10
00:00:38.220 --> 00:00:42.294
"How often do you hunt?" asked Vinnie.

11
00:00:42.295 --> 00:00:46.163
"When we need food," replied Kashe.

12
00:00:46.164 --> 00:00:49.665
"Usually we start early in the morning.

13
00:00:49.666 --> 00:00:52.136
But today I saw you and Mandy.

14
00:00:52.137 --> 00:00:54.609
I had to return to the village."

15
00:00:54.610 --> 00:00:57.173
Suddenly he stopped.

16
00:00:57.174 --> 00:01:01.821
On the ground was a pile of something that smelled bad.

17
00:01:01.822 --> 00:01:05.821
"Is that what I think it is?" asked Vinnie.

18
00:01:05.822 --> 00:01:08.800
He pinched his nose at the smell.

19
00:01:08.801 --> 00:01:12.653
Kashe and Gau looked at each other.

20
00:01:12.654 --> 00:01:14.568
"The animal dung is fresh.

21
00:01:14.569 --> 00:01:18.608
They are close," Kashe said.

22
00:01:18.609 --> 00:01:20.894
"Kashe, look here."

23
00:01:20.895 --> 00:01:24.418
Gau pointed to another pile of dung.

24
00:01:24.419 --> 00:01:28.333
"This is also fresh," Kashe replied.

25
00:01:28.334 --> 00:01:30.139
"That is not good."

26
00:01:30.140 --> 00:01:32.717
Vinnie was curious.

27
00:01:32.718 --> 00:01:35.632
"What is it?" he asked.

28
00:01:35.633 --> 00:01:39.202
Kashe pointed to the first pile and said,

29
00:01:39.203 --> 00:01:41.888
"That dung is from antelope."

30
00:01:41.889 --> 00:01:44.842
Then he pointed to the second pile.

31
00:01:44.843 --> 00:01:47.677
"But this belongs to a rhino."

32
00:01:47.678 --> 00:01:51.075
Kashe got his bow and arrow ready.

33
00:01:51.076 --> 00:01:53.221
"We must be very careful,"

34
00:01:53.222 --> 00:01:56.602
he said, as he slowly walked on.

35
00:01:56.603 --> 00:02:00.469
"Rhinos are very dangerous."

36
00:02:00.470 --> 00:02:06.830
Back at the village, Mandy and the women poured their shelled nuts into a big pile.

37
00:02:06.831 --> 00:02:09.620
Women brought out pots.

38
00:02:09.621 --> 00:02:13.842
"Let's get water," Twi said to Mandy.

39
00:02:13.843 --> 00:02:17.762
She held two white balls and gave one to Mandy.

40
00:02:17.763 --> 00:02:20.019
It had a funny smell.

41
00:02:20.020 --> 00:02:24.095
"What's this?" Mandy asked.

42
00:02:24.096 --> 00:02:28.554
"It's the shell of an ostrich egg," Twi said.

43
00:02:28.555 --> 00:02:32.615
"We use it to carry water for our meals."

44
00:02:32.616 --> 00:02:36.010
Twi led Mandy to a water hole.

45
00:02:36.011 --> 00:02:39.559
It contained only a little bit of water.

46
00:02:39.560 --> 00:02:44.678
"Is this all the water you have?" Mandy asked.

47
00:02:44.679 --> 00:02:49.786
She wondered how these people could live with so little water.

48
00:02:49.787 --> 00:02:51.491
Twi nodded.

49
00:02:51.492 --> 00:02:54.844
"Our people are travelers, like you and Vinnie.

50
00:02:54.845 --> 00:02:57.809
We journey to find water."

51
00:02:57.810 --> 00:03:02.943
She bent down and scooped some water into the eggshell.

52
00:03:02.944 --> 00:03:07.667
"This water is almost gone, so we will be moving soon."

53
00:03:07.668 --> 00:03:12.817
Mandy filled her eggshell and followed Twi to the village.

54
00:03:12.818 --> 00:03:16.608
Vinnie was careful to stay close to Kashe.

55
00:03:16.609 --> 00:03:21.670
Suddenly Kashe and Gau ran behind a large bush.

56
00:03:21.671 --> 00:03:23.311
Vinnie joined them.

57
00:03:23.312 --> 00:03:26.182
Kashe pointed ahead.

58
00:03:26.183 --> 00:03:29.381
"Oh!" Vinnie gasped.

59
00:03:29.382 --> 00:03:34.080
He saw a peaceful herd of antelope and zebras.

60
00:03:34.081 --> 00:03:39.558
Just then Kashe and Gau stood up and aimed their arrows.

61
00:03:39.559 --> 00:03:44.105
The animals sensed the hunters and started to run.

62
00:03:44.106 --> 00:03:47.400
The men shot their poison arrows.

63
00:03:47.401 --> 00:03:51.550
One hit an antelope, which kept running.

64
00:03:51.551 --> 00:03:54.195
Kashe and Gau chased after it.

65
00:03:54.196 --> 00:04:04.607
So did Vinnie.
